Subject: [PATCH] spidev: allow the ICM-42688 binding for direct userspace access

The Zynq validation image accesses this sensor directly from the shared
userspace test; keep the compatible truthful and do not bind the IIO driver.

---
 drivers/spi/spidev.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/spi/spidev.c b/drivers/spi/spidev.c
--- a/drivers/spi/spidev.c
+++ b/drivers/spi/spidev.c
@@ -693,0 +694 @@ static const struct spi_device_id spidev_spi_ids[] = {
+	{ .name = "icm42688" },
@@ -727,0 +729 @@ static const struct of_device_id spidev_dt_ids[] = {
+	{ .compatible = "invensense,icm42688", .data = &spidev_of_check },
--
2.43.0
